+/// The queue-eligibility block. A step answers the scheduler's per-queue
+/// eligible counts from the per-node crash ledger when nothing else can
+/// withhold a runnable, and walks the queues otherwise. `elements_skipped`
+/// sums the lengths of the queues answered from the ledger, so
